	<div class="container">
		<div class="row justify-content-center">
			<div class="col-md-10">
				<h2 class="mt-4 mb-4">Packaging</h2>
				<p>All Perdue Farms products are vacuum-sealed and frozen prior to shipment. To keep orders chilled while in transit, we place items in insulated coolers and surround them with dry ice (an amount appropriate for the temperatures in your region of the country). Coolers are then packaged inside branded boxes for an added layer of protection. In an effort to reduce greenhouse gasses and lessen our carbon footprint, we’ve ensured that both coolers and boxes are recyclable. Read more about <a href="/en-US/we-care.html">
              <span class="font-italic color-yellow">
                our sustainability efforts here.
              </span>
            </a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
